<title>MALAYSIA: Kemayan unit buyout aborted.</title>
<headline>Kemayan unit buyout aborted.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kemayan Corp Bhd said on Thursday that a previously-announced proposal for a management buyout of its property development unit Binabaik Sdn Bhd has been aborted.</p>
<p>In a statement, Kemayan said the unit instead will be sold for 46 million ringgit to Emerald Diffusion Sdn Bhd.</p>
<p>The buyout was withdrawn because the management team was unable to secure sufficient funds for the deal and was unable to conclude the acquisition of additional land bank for Binabaik's continued development, the statement said.</p>
<p>Kemayan is involved in property and plantations.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 201 4813)</p>
